{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:bbb08eb81d2398a1","name":"Guardian-Class Light Cruiser","source":{"id":"source:reference-bbb08eb81d2398a1","title":"Guardian-Class Light Cruiser","revision":19458,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T22:00:55Z","sha256":"57b1b046591eb7aa378a9e0314698adec066ed75d353611d4fe469c6cb045e31","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19458","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Guardian-Class%20Light%20Cruiser&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-bbb08eb81d2398a1","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Unleashed Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Unleashed_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Empire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Empire","referenceId":"reference:f9c9a48674cc3415"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A customs and inspection vessel designed by Sienar Fleet Systems, the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Guardian"]},"-Class Light Cruiser is a fast and durable ship capable of patrolling remote systems without the need for backup or support. The ",{"tag":"i","children":["Guardian"]},"-Class Light Cruiser was designed to be relatively autonomous, though of course it was not expected to fend off large-scale assaults. For the most part, the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Guardian"]},"-Class Light Cruiser handles smuggler and pirate traffic in remote systems, acting as both a command post and enforcement vessel.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Though considered a light cruiser, the ship is actually just a heavily armed ",{"tag":"a","children":["Space Transport"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Space_Transport"}," designed to let small crews patrol a star system with few amenities. Despite the fact that the ship has a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hyperdrive"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hyperdrive","re